<title>UK: BP in 120 mln bbl Alaskan offshore oil find.</title>
<headline>BP in 120 mln bbl Alaskan offshore oil find.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc on Friday confirmed it had made a find at its offshore Alaskan Liberty prospect of an estimated 120 million barrels of recoverable oil.  </p>
<p>BP said the discovery on the North Slope had commercial potential and it will go ahead with development.</p>
<p>Appraisal drilling took place in February and March on the Liberty prospect, which is about 11 miles southeast of the Endicott development and five miles offshore in the Beaufort Sea.</p>
<p>Oil was first discovered in the area in 1982.</p>
